sults\nMay 4, 2010 Primary Election Results\nNovember 3, 2009 Election Results\nOctober 6, 2009 Municipal Election Results\nNovember 4, 2008 General Election Results\nJune 24, 2008 Primary Election Results\nMay 6, 2008 Primary Election Results\nO\nctober 9, 2007 Municipal Election Results - By Contest (PDF)\nOctober 9, 2007 Municipal Election Results - By Precinct (PDF)\nMay 2006 Primary Election Results - By Contest (PDF)\nMay 2006 Primary Election Results - By Precinct (PDF)\n2006 General Election Results - By Contest (PDF)\n2006 General Election Results - By Precinct (PDF)\nNovember 2005 General Election Results - By Contest (PDF)\nNovember 2005 General Election Results - By Precinct (PDF)\nNovember 2005 Primary Election Results (PDF)\nNovember 2004 General Election Results - By Contest (PDF)\nNovember 2004 General Election Results - By Precinct (PDF)\nAugust 2004 Primary Election Results - By Contest (PDF)\nAugust 2004 Primary Election Results - By Precinct (PDF)\nJuly 2004 Primary Election Results - By Contest (PDF)\nJuly 2004 Primary Election Results - By Precinct (PDF)\nContact Us\nSusie Jordan\nDirector\nPhone: 704-878-3140\nBoard of Elections\n203 Stockton Street\nStatesville, NC 28677\nDirections\nPhone: 704-878-3140\nFax: 704-832-2312\nHours-\n(Except holidays)\nMonday - Friday\n8 a.m. - 5 p.m.\nStaff Directory\nNov. 3, 2026 General Election Information\nNC Voter Photo ID Requirement / Information\nAbsentee Voting\nVote By Mail\nVote Early in Person\nAbsentee Request Forms\nVideos on Absentee Voting\nThe Board - Meetings & Agendas\nCampaign Finance Reports\nCampaign Sign Information\nCandidates (Information about running for office)\nElected Officials\nElection Data & Results\nElection Videos\nForms & Polling Locations\nFrequently Asked Questions\nFuture Election Dates\nMilitary and Overseas Voting\nMaps\nMunicipal Election Information\nPolitical Party Contact Information\nPress Releases from the NC State Board of Election\nPrecinct Officials\nQualifications\nRequirements\nVoter Registration\nPolitical Party Affiliations\nTypes of Elections\nVerifying Voter Information\nVoter Registration Statistics\nNotify Me\u00ae\nSign up to receive email or text notifications\nPermits & Licenses\nPermits, licenses, inspections, & other legal documents\nPayments\nMake a payment online, by mail, or in person\nMaps\nGIS, directions, elections, property, & specialty maps\nEmployment\nFind career opportunities & access Employee Self Service\nPublic Records Requests\nSubmit requests for public records here\nContact Us\nIredell County Government Center\nP.O. Box 788\nStatesville, NC 28687\nPhone:\n704-878-3000\nMonday - Friday\n8:00 AM - 5:00 PM\nSocial Media\nFacebook\nInstagram\nYouTube\nQuick Links\nCOVID-19 Information\nBoard of Commissioners Meeting Videos\nSheriff's Office\nLocal Government Boards & Committees\nBudget Information\nTax Information\nBids / RFPs\nAmericans with Disabilities Notice\n/QuickLinks.aspx\nStaff Directory\nHome\nEmployee Access\nSite Map\nAccessibility\nCopyright Notices\n/QuickLinks.aspx\nGovernment Websites by\nCivicPlus\u00ae\nLoading\nLoading\nDo Not Show Again\nClose\nArrow Left\nArrow Right\n[]\nSlideshow Left Arrow\nSlideshow Right Arrow",
